{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>למסת נקיים ילעג</b> — 'הלועג' (the mocker), and the opposite of the matter, for the Place [i.e., HaShem] gives the earth into the hand of the wicked, so that he covers the face of its judges, and its meaning is like: 'and the face of Haman was covered,' that they cannot show favoritism."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:02:13.705465220Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}